исправлен door_open: A heavy, dry wooden door frame rubbing against its threshold and side jambs, low uneven creaks as wood grinds on wood, slow opening motion.
исправлен door_close: Heavy dry wooden door slams shut firmly, wood rubbing against wood at the frame and threshold, low uneven creaks and thuds.
